 "title": "Passport Information – Delta County",
 "text": "Passport Information – Delta County\nSkip to main content Enable accessibility for low vision Open the accessibility menu\nMain Menu\nFooter\n(906) 789-5100\nCounty Directory\nSearch for:\nSearch\nHow Do I...\nApply For...\nAnimal License\nBirth Certificate\nBoards/Committees\nBuilding Permit\nBusiness License\nConcealed Pistol License (CPL)\nDeath Certificate\nEmployment\nMarriage License\nPassport\nFind...\nLegal Help & Resources\nPay...\nTraffic Fine\nDelinquent Taxes\nSubmit Anonymous Tips\nRecycle\nRegister to Vote\nVideo Visit an Inmate\nView...\nBoard Agendas & Minutes\nBoard Meeting Videos\nBudget & Dashboard\nCounty Ordinances\nDocument Accessibility Training Videos\nElection Information/Results\nMaster Plan\nMission Statement\nGovernment\nCounty Offices & Services\nAdministration\nAirport\nBoard of Commissioners\nBuilding & Zoning\nClerk\nElection Information/Results\nEmergency Management\nEqualization\nParks\nProsecutor’s Office\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff’s Office\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nCourts\n47th Circuit Court\n94th District Court\nProbate Court\nFriend of the Court\nCounty Links/Directory\nAuctions\nBid Opportunities\nCounty Directory\nDelta County Landfill\nDelta Regional Child Advocacy Center\nGIS\nEmployment\nMaster Plan\nOpioid Task Force\nPlanning Commission\nRoad Commission\nTownship Information\nOnline Payments\nBuilding & Zoning\nClerk\nDistrict Court\nEqualization\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff's Office & Jail\nTreasurer\nDocuments\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoard of Commissioners\nAirport Advisory Board\nBaldwin Township\nBrampton Township\nLandfill\nLocal Emergency Planning Committee\nMaple Ridge Township\nParks & Recreation Commission\nPlanning Commission\nRoad Commission\nSearch Minutes\nOrdinances\nForms & Applications\nFreedom of Information Act (FOIA)\nEmployment Information\nPolicy & Procedure Manual\nCalendar\nCounty Meeting Calendar\nBoardroom Schedule\nRecords Search\nBirth Records\nDeath Records\nLand Records\nMarriage Records\nGIS\nTax Search\nHome\nRegister of Deeds\nPassport Information\nPassport Information\nYou must be a U.S. or Naturalized Citizen.\nComplete a passport application from the Register of Deeds office in the Courthouse or from the Travel.State.Gov website . The application must be completed in black ink only.\nProof of citizenship in the form of a birth certificate or naturalization certificate must accompany the application. It will be returned with the passport.\nRequires 1 passport photo taken within the last six months.\nYou must show valid driver’s license or a Michigan State I.D.\nRoutine service for passports now takes 4-6 weeks.\nExpedited service for passports takes 2-3 weeks.\nFEES\nPlease submit two checks or money orders in the following amounts (Effective 12/27/2021):\nAdult Passport Book:\n1. $130.00 made payable to: Dept. of State\n2. $35.00 made payable to: Delta County Register of Deeds\nMinor’s Passport-Under Age 16:\n1. $100.00 made payable to: US Dept. of State\n2. $35.00 made payable to: Delta County Register of Deeds\nCost for U.S. Passport book renewal:\n1. $130.00 for adults payable to the US Dept of State\nAdult Passport Card:\n1. $30.00 made payable to: US Dept. of State\n2. $35.00 made payable to: Delta County Register of Deeds\nMinor’s Passport Card-Under Age 16:\n1. $15.00 made payable to: US Dept. of State\n2. $35.00 made payable to: Delta County Register of Deeds\nCost for Passport Card for Passport book holders:\n1. $30.00 for adults\nIf you apply for both documents at the same time:\nAdults:\n1. $160.00 made payable to: US Dept. of State\n2. $35.00 made payable to: Delta County Register of Deeds\nMinors:\n1. $115.00 made payable to: US Dept. of State\n2. $35.00 made payable to: Delta County Register of Deeds\nExpedited Service:\nAdd $60.00 per application.\nOffice hours for submitting applications:\n8:00 am to 3:30 pm Monday – Friday\nFor more passport information:\n(906) 789-5100 *** Fax (906) 789-5179\nor visit the Travel.State.Gov website\nRegister of Deeds\nGeneral Recording Requirements\nRecording Information\nRecording Fees\nPassport Information\nOther Fees\n© 2026 Delta County Michigan, All Rights Reserved | Accessibility\nBack to top\nYou are now leaving Delta County\nDelta County provides links to web sites of other organizations in order to provide visitors with certain information. A link does not constitute an endorsement of content, viewpoint, policies, products or services of that web site. Once you link to another web site not maintained by Delta County, you are subject to the terms and conditions of that web site, including but not limited to its privacy policy. The website will be opened in a new window or tab.\nYou will be redirected to\nClick the link above to continue or CANCEL\ndeltacountymi.org\ndeltacountymi.gov",
